  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(2.697 + 0.498)2 - (2.697 - 0.498)2\n\n**Formula used:**\n\na² - b² = (a - b)(a + b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(2.697 + 0.498)2 - (2.697 - 0.498)2\n\n⇒ (2.697 + 0.498 + 2.697 - 0.498)(2.697 + 0.498 - 2.697 + 0.498)\n\n⇒ (5.394)(0.996) \n\n⇒ 5.372424\n\n**∴ (2.697 + 0.498)2 - (2.697 - 0.498)2 = 5.37 **\n\n** [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ca81259519cadfb2d5350673c220e419e60378e9770ad26512fc8e826a8d93f1.png] __Shortcut Trick__** We know that,\n\n(a + b)² - (a - b)² = 4ab\n\n(2.697 + 0.498)2 - (2.697 - 0.498)2 = 4 × 2.697 × 0.498 = 5.372424 ≈ 5.37",
